    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hm. honestly it's a bit of a headache for me. the editor-in-chief was saying that without your deep reviews, we're going to see a lot more papers getting through that are technically \"correct\" on citations but actually have massive logical flaws or flawed experimental reasoning. basically we're trading quality for auditability. they're pretty firm on the switch though.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
